  "text": "Lexar® Professional NM1090 PCIe 5.0 SSD | Lexar Overview Features Specifications Part Numbers Related products Lexar ® Professional NM1090 PCIe 5.0 SSD Category: Uncategorized Capacity 2TB No longer available Key Features: Sequential Read to 12,000MB/s Read, Sequential Write Speed up to 11,000MB/s Unique and potent heatsink features a heat-blasting fan plus bright RGB lighting DRAM-based with SLC dynamic cache to improve performance and reduce latency Supports Microsoft DirectStorage Compatible with Intel 13th and 14th gen and AMD Ryzen 7000 series CPUs Use Lexar DiskMaster disk management tool to optimize and protect the drive to achieve higher performance, better data security, and a longer lifespan Key Features: Sequential Read to 12,000MB/s Read, Sequential Write Speed up to 11,000MB/s Unique and potent heatsink features a heat-blasting fan plus bright RGB lighting DRAM-based with SLC dynamic cache to improve performance and reduce latency Supports Microsoft DirectStorage Compatible with Intel 13th and 14th gen and AMD Ryzen 7000 series CPUs Use Lexar DiskMaster disk management tool to optimize and protect the drive to achieve higher performance, better data security, and a longer lifespan Key Features: Sequential Read to 12,000MB/s Read, Sequential Write Speed up to 11,000MB/s Unique and potent heatsink features a heat-blasting fan plus bright RGB lighting DRAM-based with SLC dynamic cache to improve performance and reduce latency Supports Microsoft DirectStorage Compatible with Intel 13th and 14th gen and AMD Ryzen 7000 series CPUs Use Lexar DiskMaster disk management tool to optimize and protect the drive to achieve higher performance, better data security, and a longer lifespan Features Specifications Part Numbers Related products Features Full-throttle Performance, Maximized Cooling With lightning-fast speeds up to 12000MB/s read, 11000MB/s write and an RGB heatsink with a heat-blasting fan, the Lexar Professional NM1090 PCIe 5.0 SSD is designed for superior performance. The drive features SLC dynamic cache which improves performance and reduces latency, plus it supports Microsoft DirectStorage and is compatible with Intel 13 and 14 and AMD Ryzen 7000 series CPUs. Twice as Fast as PCIe 4.0 PCIe 5.0 speeds of up to 12000MB/s read, 11000MB/s write deliver cutting-edge performance. 2 Exceptionally Cool Design A unique and potent heatsink features a heat-blasting fan plus programmable RGB lighting for the ultimate in cool. Built to Perform The Lexar Professional NM1090 PCIe 5.0 SSD is DRAM-based and uses SLC dynamic cache to improve performance, reduce latency, and support Microsoft DirectStorage. CPU Compatibility Compatible with Intel 13 th and 14 th gen and AMD Ryzen 7000 series CPUs. Monitor Drive Health and Optimize Performance Supports Lexar DiskMaster disk management tool. Rigorously Tested All Lexar products undergo extensive testing in the Lexar Quality Labs, facilities with thousands of different cameras and digital devices to ensure performance, quality, compatibility, and reliability. Specifications Capacities 2TB Form Factor M.2 2280 Interface PCIe 5.0 Performance Sequential Read/Write: Up to 12000MB/s read, 11000MB/s write speeds¹ Random Read/Write: Up to 1400K IOPs read, 1400K IOPs write speeds Operating Temperature 0°C ~ 70°C (32°F to 158°F) Storage Temperature -40°C ~ 85°C (-40°F to 185°F) Shock 1500G, duration 0.5ms, Half Sine Wave Vibration 10-2000Hz, 1.5mm, 20G, 1 Oct/min, 30min/axis (X, Y, Z) Dimensions (L x W x H) 80 x 24 x 17.35mm / 3.15” x 0.94” x 0.68” Weight 72.5g / .16lbs Warranty 5-year limited warranty Total Bytes Written 1400TBW MTBF 1,500,000 Hours 1 Up to 12000MB/s read transfer, up to 11000MB/s write. Speeds based on internal testing. Actual performance may vary. 2 Comparison based on published performance of PCIe 4.0 drives. Actual performance may vary. Lexar is not liable for any loss of data or images. General Disclosure Product appearance, performance, software, and packaging may vary based on shipping date and available inventory. Usable Storage Disclosure Actual usable storage may be less than stated due to system formatting and other functions. 1GB = 1 billion bytes. Part Numbers North America Capacity Part Number MSRP 2TB LNM1090002T-RNANU $269.99 Sales Inquiry Form Thank you First Name Last Name Business Name Website Link Business Use Reseller System Integrator Other Email Phone Product Name Estimated Quantity Thank you for submitting your request. A member of the Lexar team will be in contact with you soon. Close Related Products Sort By: Default sorting Sort by latest Sort by name: A to Z Sort by name: Z to A Lexar ® NQ790 PCIe 4.0 SSD Read more Compare Lexar ® Professional GOLD CFexpress™ 4.0 Type B Card Read more Compare Lexar ® Professional NM800PRO M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD Read more Compare Lexar ® Professional 1066x SDXC™ UHS-I Card SILVER Series Read more Compare Click outside to hide the comparison bar Compare Selection EN ES",
